---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Halloween Fest — Fotografía de Evento · Ascndr Jaén"
  description="Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la 3ª edición de Halloween Fest Jaén. Shooting desde dentro del evento por fotógrafos @alvarojimenez7 y @bydorian__, coordinado por Ascndr, estudio creativo en Jaén."
  canonical="https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/fotografia/halloweenfest-fotografia"
>

<style is:global>
  @import "../../../styles/global.css";

  .project-page { background: #0a0a0a; color: #f0ece6; min-height: 100vh; font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif; }
  .project-nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 40px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,10,0.95), transparent); }
  .project-nav a { color: #888; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
  .project-nav a:hover { color: #f0ece6; }
  .project-nav .nav-logo { color: #f0ece6; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; }

  .project-hero { height: 70vh; min-height: 400px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
  .project-hero img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 30%; filter: brightness(0.5); }
  .project-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 0 40px 48px; width: 100%; max-width: 900px; }
  .project-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; border: 0.5px solid #333; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .project-title { font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: #f0ece6; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .project-subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: #888; letter-spacing: .04em; }

  .project-body { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 40px; }
  .project-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  .meta-item { background: #111; padding: 20px; }
  .meta-label { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .meta-value { font-size: 13px; color: #f0ece6; font-weight: 500; }

  .project-desc { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 12px; max-width: 640px; }
  .project-credits { font-size: 11px; color: #555; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: 60px; }

  .photo-grid {
    columns: 2; column-gap: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .photo-grid img {
    width: 100%; display: block;
    margin-bottom: 3px; break-inside: avoid;
    transition: filter .3s;
  }
  .photo-grid img:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }

  .project-cta { border-top: 0.5px solid #1e1e1e; padding-top: 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .cta-text { font-size: 13px; color: #555; }
  .cta-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #141414; border: 0.5px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 22px; color: #f0ece6; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .2s; }
  .cta-link:hover { border-color: #555; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .project-nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
    .project-hero-content { padding: 0 20px 32px; }
    .project-body { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .project-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .photo-grid { columns: 1; }
    .project-cta { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{`
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CreativeWork",
  "name": "Halloween Fest 3ª Edición — Fotografía de Evento",
  "description": "Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la 3ª edición de Halloween Fest Jaén desde dentro del evento.",
  "creator": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Ascndr", "url": "https://ascndrworld.com" },
  "url": "https://ascndrworld.com/trabajos/fotografia/halloweenfest-fotografia",
  "image": "https://ascndrworld.com/images/halloween-fest/portada-halloween3.jpg",
  "keywords": ["fotografía", "cobertura evento", "shooting", "Halloween", "Jaén"],
  "contributor": [
    { "@type": "Person", "name": "@alvarojimenez7" },
    { "@type": "Person", "name": "@bydorian__" }
  ],
  "locationCreated": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Jaén, España" },
  "dateCreated": "2025",
  "genre": "Fotografía · Cobertura de Evento"
}
`}</script>

<div class="project-page">

  <nav class="project-nav">
    <a href="/trabajos">← Trabajos</a>
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Ascndr</a>
    <a href="/">Contacto</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="project-hero">
    <img
      src="/images/halloween-fest/portada-halloween3.jpg"
      alt="Halloween Fest 3ª edición Jaén — Fotografía de evento Ascndr"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div class="project-hero-content">
      <span class="project-tag">Fotografía · Cobertura de Evento</span>
      <h1 class="project-title">Halloween Fest</h1>
      <p class="project-subtitle">Desde dentro · 3ª Edición · Jaén</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="project-body">

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Categoría</div>
        <div class="meta-value">Fotografía · Evento</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Año</div>
        <div class="meta-value">MMXXV</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Cliente</div>
        <div class="meta-value">Halloween Fest Jaén</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="project-desc">
      Cobertura fotográfica profesional de la tercera edición de Halloween Fest Jaén.
      Imágenes tomadas desde dentro del evento, mostrando ambiente, artistas, disfraces
      y momentos del show en directo.
    </p>
    <p class="project-credits">Shot by: @alvarojimenez7 · @bydorian__ · Todos los derechos reservados.</p>

    <div class="photo-grid">
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-01.jpg" alt="Escenario Halloween Fest 3ª edición Jaén — fotografía Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-06.jpg" alt="DJ vinilo Halloween Fest Jaén — cobertura fotográfica" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-03.jpg" alt="Escenario luces azules Halloween Fest Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-04.jpg" alt="Pista de baile Halloween Fest Jaén — Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-08.jpg" alt="DJ zombie Halloween Fest Jaén — fotografía evento" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-02.jpg" alt="Escenario luces amarillas Halloween Fest Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-10.jpg" alt="Asistentes disfrazados Halloween Fest Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-11.jpg" alt="Disfraces Halloween Fest Jaén — Ascndr fotografía" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-07.jpg" alt="DJ Pioneer Halloween Fest Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-09.jpg" alt="Artista en escenario Halloween Fest Jaén" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-12.jpg" alt="Staff Halloween Fest Jaén — fotografía Ascndr" loading="lazy"/>
      <img src="/images/halloween-fest/hw3-13.jpg" alt="Equipo Halloween Fest Jaén — Ascndr estudio creativo" loading="lazy"/>
    </div>

    <div class="project-cta">
      <p class="cta-text">¿Necesitas cobertura fotográfica para tu evento?</p>
      <a href="/" class="cta-link">Hablemos →</a>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

</Layout>
